<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48549" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θεσσαλ-ικός</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θεττ-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <u>Thessalian</u>:
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θ. ἕδος</span>, a sort of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>chair</i> or <i>couch</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.128
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίφρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					58
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.112
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θ. ἔνθεσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermipp.
					41
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θ. δεῖπνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					492
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				34.3
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Crates Com.
					19
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of the Thessalian dialect</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Synt.</u>
					214.6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαίρεσις</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				50.9
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pron.</u>
					109.1
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Synt.</u>
					159.9
				</span></i>
			.</div>
